---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { filmography } from "../data/career";
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  heading="About"
  description="Dmitri Ginzburg, a software engineer in London working on machine learning, GPU computing and computer graphics."
  lede="Software engineer in London. I work on machine-learning models, GPU inference, computer graphics and the production software that has to carry all three."
  path="/about/"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="block narrative">
      <p>
        My work has followed one question for most of my career: how to get a
        high-quality image out of a renderer for less compute, and how to make
        the software that does it reliable enough for other people to depend
        on.
      </p>
      <p>
        That started in animation and VFX, where I worked as a technical
        director and supervisor before moving into software. The first denoiser
        I built came out of a production problem: renders that were too
        expensive at the sample counts the shots needed. It ended up
        deployed across four titles. The same question later led into machine
        learning: training models on rendered data, writing the CUDA kernels and
        inference engines that run them, and building the backend services and
        pipelines that put them in front of artists.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today that means model development and evaluation, inference
        optimisation, and the integration work that turns a trained model into
        software other people use.
      </p>
      <ul class="actions">
        <li><a href={site.links.github}>GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href={site.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Selected credits</h2>
      <p class="note">
        Feature and series work I contributed to as an engineer or technical
        director. Full list on{" "}
        <a href={site.links.imdb} target="_blank" rel="noopener">IMDb</a>; the
        lighting and look-development side is on{" "}
        <a href={site.links.artstation} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          ArtStation
        </a>.
      </p>
      <ul class="credits">
        {
          filmography.map((film) => (
            <li>
              <span class="year">{film.year}</span>
              <span class="film">
                <em>{film.title}</em>
                {film.studio && <span class="studio"> · {film.studio}</span>}
              </span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul class="education">
        <li>
          <h3>Bachelor of Engineering, Microelectronics</h3>
          <p>
            National Research University of Electronic Technology (MIET),
            Moscow · 2008–2014
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Machine Learning Specialization</h3>
          <p>
            DeepLearning.AI and Stanford Online · Issued December 2025 ·{" "}
            <a
              href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/specialization/A6K6ATKRPELV"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
            >Credential</a>
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .block {
    padding-block: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 74ch;
  }

  .block + .block {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .narrative {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .note {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .credits {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .credits li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }

  .year {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .studio {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .education {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .education h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .education p {
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
</style>
